  TutorialTasks:
  - Step: 8
    Text: Enemies come in through the GATE. Defeat them and protect your CORE.
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: 'Welcome!'
    Focus:
    - 2
    - 1
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: This is ORE. Drills mine shapes from it. Shapes are your money and your ammo.
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: 4, y: 11}
    Ghost: []
    Opens:
    - 1
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Ore
    Focus:
    - 3
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: The buildings you can use appear down here.
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Build bar
    Focus:
    - 12
    Reveal: 4
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 9
    Text: 'Press 2, or click the DRILL.'
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Pick the drill
    Focus:
    - 5
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 0
    Text: 'Click the glowing tile. Its arrow must point DOWN, toward the Core.'
    Hint: Press Q or E to turn it before you click.
    Target: {x: 4, y: 11}
    Ghost:
    - Build: 1
      Cell: {x: 4, y: 11}
      Facing: 2
    Opens:
    - 0
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Place the drill
    Focus:
    - 4
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 10
    Text: 'Press 1, or click the BELT.'
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Pick the belt
    Focus:
    - 5
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 1
    Text: Press on the DRILL and drag down into the Core.
    Hint: 'Start the drag on the drill itself, then let go on the Core.'
    Target: {x: 4, y: 11}
    Ghost:
    - Build: 0
      Cell: {x: 4, y: 10}
      Facing: 2
    - Build: 0
      Cell: {x: 4, y: 9}
      Facing: 2
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Lay the belt
    Focus:
    - 3
    - 4
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: Your first shape reached the Core. This number goes up with every shape you bank.
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens:
    - 9
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: 'Success!'
    Focus:
    - 6
    Reveal: 2
    AddsOre:
    - Cell: {x: 9, y: 2}
      Mineral: 1
    - Cell: {x: 10, y: 2}
      Mineral: 1
    - Cell: {x: 9, y: 3}
      Mineral: 1
    - Cell: {x: 10, y: 3}
      Mineral: 1
  - Step: 11
    Text: 'Turrets shoot enemies. Press 0, or click the TURRET.'
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Pick the turret
    Focus:
    - 5
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 12
    Text: 'Click the glowing tile, next to the enemies'' road.'
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: 12, y: 3}
    Ghost:
    - Build: 9
      Cell: {x: 12, y: 3}
      Facing: 1
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Place the turret
    Focus:
    - 4
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 2
    Text: 'Turrets fire the shapes you feed them. Drill the new ore (arrow RIGHT), then belt it into the turret.'
    Hint: 'Drill on the glowing ore tile, turned with Q/E, then drag a belt from the drill to the turret.'
    Target: {x: 10, y: 3}
    Ghost:
    - Build: 1
      Cell: {x: 10, y: 3}
      Facing: 1
    - Build: 0
      Cell: {x: 11, y: 3}
      Facing: 1
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Load the turret
    Focus:
    - 4
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: 'The turret has ammo. Now, the top of the screen.'
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: 'Loaded!'
    Focus:
    - 11
    Reveal: 1
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: 'Your Core''s health. If it reaches zero, you lose.'
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Core health
    Focus:
    - 7
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: 'Which wave is next, and when it comes. Clear every wave to win.'
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: []
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Waves
    Focus:
    - 8
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: 'The shape these enemies are weak to. This wave: a full circle, which your drill makes.'
